            },
            "description": "**Rate limit:** 5 req / 5 min per IP.\n\n**Validation:**\n- `token` (required) — from password-reset email link\n- `newPassword` 8–72 chars; uppercase + lowercase + digit + special\n- `confirmPassword` must equal `newPassword`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
